  "description": "A formal event held by the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame to honor inductees. The 19th annual event implies a long-standing tradition and significance. The phrase 'back to the... hall of fame' implies a return or re-induction, which is a real-world concept in the Hall of Fame's history, where some artists are inducted multiple times or honored again for new contributions.",
